// The 106 terms, verbatim in scope from the principal's supplied list (23 August 2026),
// grouped into the syllabus's 12 modules (docs/curriculum/syllabus.md). This file is the
// single source the auto-generated questions are built from, so a definition here is a
// taught claim: keep each one true, and where a figure is a convention the def says so.
//
// Shape: { id, term, def, mod, expand?, img?, imgAlt? }
//   id      stable slug (progress is keyed on it — never reuse or rename casually)
//   term    the market's word, exactly
//   def     the definition, standalone-readable (used as MCQ text and review explanation)
//   mod     module id (see MODULES below)
//   expand  full form, for "write it out" questions on abbreviations
//   img     optional photo (public/img/) shown with auto-generated questions on this term

